== Usage ==
=== Upgrading and Dungeonizing Items ===
'''Essence''' can be used to upgrade and [[Dungeonizing|Dungeonize]] items. Each [[Star Upgrades|Star Upgrade]] grants a {{Green|+2%}} stat boost. Dungeon Items grant a {{Green|+10%}} stat boost per Star Upgrade while in the [[Catacombs]].

[[Dungeon Items]] can have a maximum of {{Green|5}} Star Upgrades; Other items can have a maximum of up to {{Green|15}} Star Upgrades.

A list of all items that can be upgraded by '''Essence''' are outlined below:
{{Tabview
|button = Show Items
|-|:Essence/List
}}

=== Essence Shops ===
{{Main|Essence Shops}}

'''Essence''' can be spent at several different [[Essence Shops]] for exclusive perks and items.

==Trivia== 
* {{Item|Sun Gecko Essence}} is the only '''Essence''' not on the [[Bazaar]], due to it being [[Rift]]-exclusive.
* Purchasing most '''Essence''' from the [[Bazaar]] requires {{Skill|Catacombs|20}}, except for {{Item|Forest Essence}} and {{Item|Fossil Essence}}.
* The maximum amount of '''Essence''' a player may have of one type is 2 billion.

